OL,5,G2100 The Negotiator
OL,6,     FBrand new series: French comic
OL,7,     Fcrime drama. When a botched raid
OL,8,     Fon a jewellery store causes chaos,
OL,9,     FAntoine must negotiate the release
OL,10,     Fof two hostages - singer Lady Y
OL,11,     Fand her fan.
OL,12,G2205 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FIt's a busy day at King's, as 400
OL,14,     Fpatients are treated in 24 hours.
OL,15,     FPeggy, who's 85, comes in with her
OL,16,     Fdoting husband. And Ben's swollen
OL,17,     Ffinger is more serious than he
OL,18,     Frealises.
